---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: clickbench_q22"
---
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                    |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: c DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=10                                                                                      |
|               |   Projection: hits.SearchPhrase, min(hits.URL), count(Int64(1)) AS c                                                    |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[hits.SearchPhrase]], aggr=[[min(hits.URL), count(Int64(1))]]                                   |
|               |       Filter: hits.SearchPhrase != LargeUtf8("") AND hits.URL LIKE LargeUtf8("%google%")                                |
|               |         TableScan: hits projection=[URL, SearchPhrase]                                                                  |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [c@2 DESC], fetch=10                                                                           |
|               |   ProjectionExec: expr=[SearchPhrase@0 as SearchPhrase, min(hits.URL)@1 as min(hits.URL), count(Int64(1))@2 as c]       |
|               |     SortExec: TopK(fetch=10), expr=[count(Int64(1))@2 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[true]                               |
|               |       AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[SearchPhrase@0 as SearchPhrase], aggr=[min(hits.URL), count(Int64(1))] |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([SearchPhrase@0], 16), input_partitions=16                                   |
|               |           AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[SearchPhrase@1 as SearchPhrase], aggr=[min(hits.URL), count(Int64(1))]      |
|               |             FilterExec: SearchPhrase@1 !=  AND URL@0 LIKE %google%                                                      |
|               |               SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                        |
|               |                 BytesProcessedExec                                                                                      |
|               |                   DataSourceExec: partitions=16, partition_sizes=[<redacted>]                                           |
|               |                                                                                                                         |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
